    "description": "We at Hindalco Industries Ventures Solutions are looking for an experienced Process Engineer based out of Rajkot. If you are a result-oriented professional with a passion for excellence, we want to hear from you.\n\nAbout Hindalco Industries Ventures Solutions:\nHindalco Industries Ventures Solutions is a leading organization in the Hybrid sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Coordinate with logistics for dispatching finished goods\n• Prepare production cost analysis and efficiency reports\n• Implement 5S, Kaizen, and Six Sigma practices on the shop floor\n• Coordinate with design and engineering teams on product improvements\n• Ensure product quality meets internal and customer specifications\n• Manage raw material procurement and inventory levels\n• Ensure environmental compliance and waste management\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• B.Ed / M.Ed from a recognized institution\n• 10-15 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in GD&T\n• Proficiency in Lean Manufacturing\n• Proficiency in Six Sigma\n• Proficiency in Root Cause Analysis\n• Proficiency in Quality Control\n• Proficiency in TPM\n• Proficiency in Supply Chain Management\n• Proficiency in SAP MM/PP\n\nWork Mode: Hybrid - Flexible work-from-home and office\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• International travel opportunities for senior roles\n• Maternity and paternity leave\n• Company-sponsored certifications\n• Annual paid leaves and casual leaves\n• Work-from-home flexibility\n• Learning & development budget\n• Salary Range: 20 LPA - 40 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Rajkot, Gujarat, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with Hindalco Industries Ventures Solutions!",
